  "Description": "VISTA (Visualization and Integrated System for\nTranscriptomic Analysis) runs bulk RNA-seq differential\nexpression with DESeq2, edgeR or limma-voom, or a DESeq2/edgeR\nconsensus, and keeps counts, results for every contrast, gene\nannotation, colours and analysis parameters in one validated\nSummarizedExperiment-derived object. Plotting functions, GO,\nKEGG and MSigDB enrichment, optional cell-type deconvolution\nand a Quarto report all read that object, and an exported\nbenchmark checks its results against independent DESeq2, edgeR\nand limma runs.",
